# Input

```scss
:heading(1 2){color:red}
:heading(1.0){color:red}
:heading(1e0){color:red}
:heading(1,){color:red}
.outer-semicolon { &:heading(1; width:7px; } .after-semicolon{color:green}
.outer-brace { &:heading(1 } .after-brace{color:green}

```


